 ### SCENARIO-PHASE4-055: Hardened GAP-4 Verified lp85 L3 Advance Or Honest No-Solve
 **Description:** Running Exp 4190 either writes `blocked_arc_offline_fixtures_missing` when the survey, prior Exp 4179/4187 evidence, or local `lp85-305b61c3` fixture cannot support the attempt, writes `complete: incremental_progress_no_solve_<game>_L<n>_<reason>` when exploration, induction, hardened held-out GAP-4 validation, or real-env confirmation fails, or writes `success: incremental_progress_<game>_advanced_to_L<n>_total<m>` only when the offline real environment confirms a new level counter increment after the validated suffix. A successful run MUST keep `total_games_solved=13`, increment `total_levels_solved` from 14 to 15, set `levels_completed=3`, set `new_levels_solved_this_task=1`, set `real_env_confirmed=true`, set `verifier_validated=true`, preserve observe -> replay -> explore -> induce -> hardened-gap4-verify -> act trace evidence, and set `acceptance_gate_passed=true`. An honest no-solve run MUST keep `total_levels_solved=14`, set `new_levels_solved_this_task=0`, set `real_env_confirmed=false`, preserve the failed target evidence in `solve_trace`, and still satisfy the acceptance gate when `honest_verdict` is terminal-prefixed with `complete:`.
+
+### REQ-PHASE4-056: ARC-AGI-3 Live-Env Grounding Probe
+**Description:** The system SHALL run Exp 4191 as the first bounded live ARC-AGI-3 grounding probe for the existing offline harness. It MUST first check that `import arc_agi` succeeds and that `https://three.arcprize.org` is reachable; if either precondition fails it MUST stop with `honest_verdict="blocked_arc_live_unreachable"`. Before touching the live SDK, it MUST offline-validate the live adapter against a recorded fixture that exercises the same reset, step, transition-recording, and score-normalization path used for the live run. When preconditions pass, it MUST instantiate the official SDK with an anonymous key in online mode, enumerate live environments, select one easy bounded probe environment, run only a small random/greedy baseline budget, read a real `EnvironmentScore` from the SDK scorecard path, and map north-star accuracy to `EnvironmentScore.score/levels_completed` and efficiency to actions taken versus `EnvironmentInfo.baseline_actions`. The run MUST NOT close a competition scorecard, submit to the official leaderboard, or claim any Carnot scored online result. The terminal artifact `results/experiment_4191_arc_live_env_grounding_probe.json` MUST include bare top-level fields `honest_verdict`, `live_env_reachable`, `real_metric_mapping`, `random_greedy_baseline`, `no_leaderboard_submission`, and `preconditions_checked`, and MUST annotate the principles for those fields: `Terminal-prefixed. An honest blocked_arc_live_unreachable is a COMPLETE grounding verdict; so is a successful reachability + baseline probe.`, `Bare bool: the live SDK connected with an anonymous key and returned a real EnvironmentScore; the §0 grounding the whole north-star harness needs.`, `{accuracy: EnvironmentScore.score/levels_completed, efficiency: actions_vs_baseline_actions} — the REAL-env metric pipeline the offline proof feeds into.`, `The reference numbers (score + actions) for the probed env; the floor any Carnot run must beat before operator-gated online submission.`, `Bare bool: zero scorecards were submitted (Operator-Only External Publication; the online quota gate).`, and `Records the SDK + network reachability checks; pre-empts the silent-missing-resource fabrication mode.`.
+
+### SCENARIO-PHASE4-056: Live SDK Reachability Or Honest Blocker Without Leaderboard Submission
+**Description:** Running Exp 4191 either writes `blocked_arc_live_unreachable` when the SDK import or ARC endpoint reachability precondition fails, or writes a terminal-prefixed `complete:` artifact only after the adapter replay fixture passes, the anonymous-key SDK enumerates live environments, a bounded random/greedy baseline run returns a real `EnvironmentScore`, and `no_leaderboard_submission=true`. A successful reachable artifact MUST set `live_env_reachable=true`, include the selected environment id, action budget, actions taken, baseline action reference, score, levels completed, and `actions_vs_baseline_actions` inside `random_greedy_baseline`, preserve the real metric mapping exactly as `accuracy=EnvironmentScore.score/levels_completed` and `efficiency=actions_vs_baseline_actions`, record that online mode used an anonymous key, and keep the run bounded to reachability/baseline probing rather than a scored online Carnot submission.
